  "name": "Wildcard Hero's enslaved Darkhound uses its energy abilities, also when loaded from the database (#8291)",
  "contract": [
    "Enslave Demon 890 teaches Summon Demon 884, whose starter demon is Decrepit Darkhound 1547 (family 105). Its",
    "kit (SkillLine 2 'Pet - Darkhound') costs energy: Infected Wound 80138 costs 20 energy and deals 140% weapon",
    "damage. #9368 sets a tamed non-beast's power type from its kit in OnInitStatsForLevel, so the demon must have a",
    "full energy bar and land Infected Wound through native autocast, before and after a relog reloads it from the",
    "database. The Summoner's Stone appearance part of the report is cosmetic and not covered here.",
    "The demon is then dismissed and called again, which loads it from the database, and must still have energy and land Infected Wound. A relog is not used: the harness turns Wildcard on with the console toggle, which the login recompute drops (mask 0), so after a relog the owner is no longer a Wildcard Hero and the loaded pet has no type.",
    "Pet::LoadPetFromDB loads the spell book in a query-holder callback after the pet is already in the world, so the kit-known assert waits for it (within_ms); asserted in the summon tick it reads 0."
  ],
